Z||000001||SLYGUY||10-28-2001||02:18 AM||||You are right about one thing Sootah, Fieros are low. You are missing the point however.<P>I think I can speak for most when I tell you that we want to get rid of the massive amounts of fender gap that you see on most Fieros. I've seen more than a few with small 13 inch wheels, tremendously tall OEM size fluffy tall tires and at least 3-4 inches of fender gap on top of that.<P>The roofline is much shorter than most sedans and subcompacts, the seating position is low, but the fender gap makes it look like you could go rock climbing or maybe rally race or something.<P>That is what I'd like to get rid of soon anyways.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly||||reg||1
